06:21.742 --> 06:29.263
[SPEAKER_00]: Using your Arcana roll, you spend four hours working on this homoculi.

06:29.863 --> 06:34.184
[SPEAKER_00]: This is a DC 15 roll to be able to go through the instructions.

06:34.224 --> 06:37.625
[SPEAKER_00]: You need to roll a 12 to make one that is acceptable.

06:38.507 --> 06:38.847
