06:39.547 --> 06:48.209
[SPEAKER_00]: The way this works is that every point above a DC 15, the resulting homoculi will have one hit point.

06:49.609 --> 06:52.790
[SPEAKER_00]: So if you roll a 16, you create a homoculi with one hit point.

06:53.810 --> 06:57.651
